<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australis tops turnover lists.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australis tops turnover lists.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in pay television operator Australis Media Ltd topped turnover lists in early trade on Thursday with over 13 million shares changing hands.</p>
<p>By 11.15 a.m. (0015 GMT), Australis shares were 2.5 cents higher at 18 cents with traders saying continued talk of rationalisation in the profit-scarce industry seemed to have sparked the interest.</p>
<p>&quot;There is more and more speculation that the industry is due for some changes,&quot; said a Sydney broker.  </p>
<p>Australis reported a net loss for the six months to December 31, 1996 of A$141.93 million.</p>
<p>By 11.40 a.m. (0140 GMT), Australis shares were three cents higher at 18.5 cents on turnover of 14.4 million shares.</p>
<p>--Walter Watson 61-2 9373-1810</p>
